# Dev server control (this repo only)

Do not run `pnpm dev`, and do not start, stop, or restart any dev server in this project. The user runs the server on their machine.

When a restart is needed (for example after `next.config.mjs` changes), tell the user to restart it. For browser verification, ask whether the server is already running instead of launching it.
